      "aircraft": {
        "note": "The aircraft ladder refuses a tie the same way. Ten of these are loadout configurations of an Arma 3 fictional type, and eight are ArmaFPV drones no published source designates. The rest tie above the family rung: a shared reporting name held as a curated alias of two marks (falcon, hornet, merlin, pavehawk, black hawk), a role word several entries carry (cas, gunship), the AH-64 marks' shared ah64 with ah6 as a substring of every AH-64 query, and the Mi-8MTV-3 whose mi8 ties against the Mi-8T and Mi-8AMTSh. Capturing the family word would answer a different mark in each case. Closing one needs the mark's own designation in the class or display text.",
        "unresolved": 0
      },
