      "vehicles": {
        "note": "Every class here is named by its own text at a layer the runtime would refuse as a tie, or names no entry at all. A tie is answered as an empty result by the engine, so the measurement reports the class as open even where a weaker layer would have guessed. Closing one needs a term the class's own text carries and no other class does.",
